KNOWNBUG
string_method_task1.sv

^EXIT=(2|10)$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^Invariant check failed$
--
A method call used as a task-enable statement fails the precondition
expr.id() == ID_verilog_identifier in
convert_function_call_or_task_enable. Strings are not supported, but this
should be an error message, as for method calls in expressions.
